# I think your actual ingestion architecture is now obvious

Don't create:

```text
scrapers/
  random_site_1.py
  random_site_2.py
  random_site_3.py
```

Create:

```text
sources/
│
├── demographics/
│   ├── worldpop
│   ├── unwpp
│   ├── dhs
│   └── ipums
│
├── material_conditions/
│   ├── worldbank_pip
│   ├── data360
│   └── dhs
│
├── labour/
│   └── ilostat
│
├── production/
│   └── opensupplyhub
│
├── trade/
│   └── un_comtrade
│
├── companies/
│   ├── opencorporates
│   └── bhrrc
│
├── aid/
│   └── iati
│
├── humanitarian/
│   ├── hdx
│   └── reliefweb
│
├── conflict/
│   └── acled
│
├── news/
│   └── gdelt
│
└── geography/
    ├── osm
    └── worldpop
```

Normalize everything to a few entities:

```text
PersonGroup
Household
Place
Facility
Company
Product
Commodity
Occupation
Event
Project
Organization
Indicator
Observation
Source
Claim
```

Then relationships:

```text
PERSON_GROUP --works_at--> FACILITY
FACILITY --supplies--> COMPANY
FACILITY --produces--> PRODUCT
PRODUCT --contains--> COMMODITY
COMMODITY --traded_from--> PLACE
COMPANY --subject_of--> CLAIM
EVENT --affects--> PLACE
PERSON_GROUP --lives_in--> PLACE
PROJECT --funded_by--> ORGANIZATION
PROJECT --operates_in--> PLACE
```

**This graph is Unignorant.**

The frontend is merely different projections of it.

